  "deviceForm_editDevice": "Change the device",
  "deviceForm_help": "This window allows you to create or edit a device record in Companion.\n\nEnter a name that makes it easy to identify the phone or tablet. This name is required.\n\nSelect the device’s platform: iOS or Android.\n\nYou can assign the device to a practitioner from the list or choose the “shared device” option to avoid assigning it to a specific practitioner.\n\nClick “Create” to add the device or “Save” to confirm the changes. “Cancel” closes the window without applying the changes.\n\nOpening and closing this help window preserves your entries in the form.",
