  "episodeReferents_help": "This window allows you to select the referring physical therapist and the prescribing physician associated with the treatment plan.\n\nSelect the professionals from the lists. You can also remove an association by selecting the “No professional” option.\n\nThe management buttons to the right of the lists allow you to access the profiles of practitioners and external contacts, particularly to add a missing professional.\n\nClick “Save” to apply the selected associations. Changes to the primary physical therapist are saved in the treatment history.\n\n“Cancel” discards the association changes made in this window. Any records created from the management screens remain saved.",
