  "referringPractitionerHistory_help": "This window displays the practitioners who have been designated as primary care providers for this care episode.\n\nEach row shows the practitioner’s name and their assignment period. The label “Current Primary Care Provider” identifies the practitioner currently associated with the episode.\n\nThe label “Archived” means that the practitioner’s record has been archived; their name remains visible in the history.\n\nThis window is for viewing the history only. Close it to return to the care episode.",
